{{Unobtainable Unit|Update 18.5 - Sacred Planet}}

==Overview==
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a {{Rarity|Secret}} {{LU}}. He can only be obtained via completing [[Secret Portal|Golden Portal]] (guaranteed if you are the host).

