cid:article.text:
{{Unobtainable Unit}}

== Overview ==
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a {{Rarity|Secret}} {{LU}}. He can only be obtained by clearing the Nightmare Hunt with an estimated 0.5% chance, which increases up to 1% as you bring in Halloween 2023 units/skins.

{{EvolutionTable}}
{{Takedowns|5000}}

== Stats Overview ==
{{Tower Infobox
|caption1="I Am The All-Range....A̵̡͓͉͛̕̕T̵͖̞̫͛̾͝O̴̦̘͕͆̓͊M̸̻̻͕̔̾͑I̸̟̻̔̔͆C̴͓̦͊͝͝"
|caption2="Once upon a time, there was a man who wished to withstand a nuclear bomb. The man developed his muscles, honed his mind, and perfected his skills. However, there were yet heights he could not attain. But I couldn't allow myself to give up. So after years upon years of training, I arrived at a single solution. If I don't want to be vaporized in a nuclear explosion... I simply have to become nuclear myself."
}}{{Main_Stats}}

== Selling ==
Units sell for 25% of their deployment cost and upgrades.

== Trivia ==

* He and his [[Umbra (Nuclear)|evolved form]] are the second units to not deal Physical, Magic or Burn damage. Their case is ''purely'' true damage/dark.

